{"pageProps":{"note":{"id":"zettel.20260505180210","title":"Total ownership cost local LLM mencakup listrik, PSU, casing, dan maintenance","desc":"Upgrade GPU ke 4090 bukan cuma soal VRAM; itu soal ekosistem hardware dan biaya operasi.","updated":1777985390759,"created":1777983817035,"tags":["zettel","hardware","llm","cost"],"custom":{},"fname":"zettel.20260505180210","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"53590dcb7fd12fff8a0b295394e734b0","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.20260505180210","id":"zettel.20260505180210","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.zettel","alias":"zettel","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.zettel"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.20260505180210","id":"zettel.20260505180210","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.hardware","alias":"hardware","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.hardware"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.20260505180210","id":"zettel.20260505180210","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.llm","alias":"llm","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.llm"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.20260505180210","id":"zettel.20260505180210","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.cost","alias":"cost","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.cost"}},{"from":{"fname":"zettel.moc.local-llm","id":"zettel.moc.local-llm","vaultName":"vault"},"type":"backlink","position":{"start":{"line":17,"column":3,"offset":758},"end":{"line":17,"column":28,"offset":783},"indent":[]},"value":"zettel.20260505180210"}],"anchors":{},"children":[],"parent":"zettel","data":{}},"body":"<h1 id=\"total-ownership-cost-local-llm-mencakup-listrik-psu-casing-dan-maintenance\">Total ownership cost local LLM mencakup listrik, PSU, casing, dan maintenance<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#total-ownership-cost-local-llm-mencakup-listrik-psu-casing-dan-maintenance\"></a></h1>\n<p>Local LLM bukan cuma CAPEX GPU. Total ownership cost meliputi:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>PSU 1000W Gold,</li>\n<li>case dengan airflow dan clearance besar,</li>\n<li>support bracket,</li>\n<li>NVMe kencang,</li>\n<li>RAM 64–128GB,</li>\n<li>listrik dan pendinginan.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Untuk RTX 4090 full-load, total konsumsi bisa mendekati 500–700W, jadi biaya listrik dan infrastruktur harus masuk hitungan.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"tags\">Tags<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#tags\"></a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li><a class=\"color-tag\" style=\"--tag-color: #a03623;\" href=\"/sotoy/notes/tags.zettel\">zettel</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">hardware (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">llm (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">cost (Private)</a></li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<strong>Backlinks</strong>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.moc.local-llm\">MOC Local LLM dan Copilot agent</a></li>\n</ul>","noteIndex":{"id":"root","title":"Hello and Welcome! 👋","desc":"","updated":1778468084907,"created":1724251163400,"tags":["x","twitter"],"custom":{"nav_order":0,"permalink":"/"},"fname":"root","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"fbada016be66dbd4790f7e49ede05b67","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.x","alias":"x","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.x"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.twitter","alias":"twitter","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.twitter"}}],"anchors":{"find-more":{"type":"header","text":"Find More","value":"find-more","line":23,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":["book-summaries","daily","handbook","notes","tags","til","zettel"],"parent":null,"data":{},"body":"\nWelcome to the homepage! I use Dendron to store and organize notes, ideas, and experiments I’m working on. Here are the main sections you’ll find on this site:\n\n1. **Learning Notes** — Practical notes on programming, recent technologies, and productivity tips.\n2. **Personal Projects** — Summaries of projects, experiments, and outcomes I’m working on or have completed.\n3. **Writings & Opinions** — Casual articles and reflections about technology, daily life, and other interesting topics.\n\nI’m constantly experimenting and learning. I hope the content here helps you as a reference, a starting point for discussion, or just light reading.\n\n> Why Dendron?\n>\nDendron helps keep notes organized. Its \"seed\" and \"vault\" concepts make it easy to structure content and find what you need.\n\n## Find More\n\nIf you want to learn more or connect, check these links:\n\n- [Homepage (Dendron)](https://zeihanaulia.github.io/sotoy/)\n- [My GitHub](https://github.com/zeihanaulia)\n- [My Twitter / X](https://x.com/zeihanaulia)\n\nThanks for stopping by. If you have feedback or want to chat, feel free to reach out.\n"},"collectionChildren":null,"customHeadContent":null,"config":{"version":5,"dev":{"enablePreviewV2":true},"commands":{"lookup":{"note":{"selectionMode":"extract","confirmVaultOnCreate":true,"vaultSelectionModeOnCreate":"smart","leaveTrace":false,"bubbleUpCreateNew":true,"fuzzThreshold":0.2}},"randomNote":{},"insertNoteLink":{"aliasMode":"none","enableMultiSelect":false},"insertNoteIndex":{"enableMarker":false},"copyNoteLink":{"aliasMode":"title"},"templateHierarchy":"template"},"workspace":{"dendronVersion":"0.83.0","vaults":[{"fsPath":"vault"}],"journal":{"dailyDomain":"daily","name":"journal","dateFormat":"y.MM.dd","addBehavior":"childOfDomain"},"scratch":{"name":"scratch","dateFormat":"y.MM.dd.HHmmss","addBehavior":"asOwnDomain"},"task":{"name":"","dateFormat":"","addBehavior":"childOfCurrent","statusSymbols":{"":" ","wip":"w","done":"x","assigned":"a","moved":"m","blocked":"b","delegated":"l","